{"id": "travel-eval-validation-001", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "45b775a94625e90fd7f97ee66102cc652e6e5c2aa585d2a642571961747b53fc", "prompt_tokens": 411, "generated_tokens": 43, "generation_seconds": 1.977, "answer": "厦门站更适合前往中山路、沙坡尾、曾厝垵等岛内片区；厦门北站更适合高铁网络转场，但到主要旅游区通常还要继续接驳。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-002", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "0663a467196e2d0dd3049288017348f8d5cae7fc9d3b5078dd74e53892da0644", "prompt_tokens": 402, "generated_tokens": 41, "generation_seconds": 1.8953, "answer": "不能直接从城区步行上岛，必须通过轮渡。游客要先到指定码头，再完成船票、候船、乘船和步行入岛等流程。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-003", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "1f3d5489158d69ec104bee1034b34ced7e9bd21f1ae48035a7879e2267e64db3", "prompt_tokens": 402, "generated_tokens": 43, "generation_seconds": 2.033, "answer": "可以优先考虑点对点打车，适合带行李、多人同行或时间有限的情况。厦门岛内各热门片区距离相对可控，打车在自由行里很常见。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-004", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "42f53192a98510555eb630a6c7733ea6c2119682f5908643a287a547c309716e", "prompt_tokens": 400, "generated_tokens": 35, "generation_seconds": 1.6215, "answer": "鼓浪屿的核心价值是整座岛的建筑、坡道、小巷、街区氛围和步行体验，适合留主要时段慢慢逛。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-005", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "bbe4d53af27526113563b4fdec84fa5ad2e7ff227c676ba9385c94002c0fae5a", "prompt_tokens": 539, "generated_tokens": 60, "generation_seconds": 2.7693, "answer": "简餐可优先考虑沙茶面，它适合早餐、午餐或轻食场景，能体现厦门主食的代表性。[1]\n\n姜母鸭更适合作为正餐补充，适合搭配海鲜或滨海休闲场景，可按正餐需求安排。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-006", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "f627953ede8c4a1b1346c6ac39afad41af2609e60b7d0dbcb46d66bb97eab119", "prompt_tokens": 421, "generated_tokens": 57, "generation_seconds": 2.6302, "answer": "鼓浪屿适合慢游、拍照和住一晚体验，夜晚和清晨的氛围与白天不同，能沉浸感受岛上节奏。[1]\n\n但搬运行李、上岛组织和返程节奏更复杂，更适合愿意为体验接受这些不便的人。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-007", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "729e670b50b88d279fcf4a46b4eceb5c2748b28b8e4127ff06edd628923706da", "prompt_tokens": 413, "generated_tokens": 44, "generation_seconds": 2.0483, "answer": "可以按海边休闲和城市慢节奏来安排。资料把环岛路和曾厝垵定位为“住在厦门的生活感”，适合把沙滩、骑行、散步和轻松餐饮结合起来。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-008", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "5432528484abd4ac2dcf6e00f0c3af93aa349368a4edb059759c25b8b135dfa5", "prompt_tokens": 503, "generated_tokens": 94, "generation_seconds": 4.4368, "answer": "资料认为鼓浪屿更适合边逛边吃，但真正想做系统觅食，还是本岛更完整。[1]\n\n资料把本岛老城作为主线，认为中山路、八市和老城片区更容易串起沙茶面、海蛎煎和甜汤类食物。[1]\n\n资料也提到海边区域适合把吃饭和休闲放一起，但没有把鼓浪屿作为系统觅食的主战场。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-009", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "fed6eaee3dfcc32ece99c01e7eb83d09cadcabafb6b170900385fa60f539a9d3", "prompt_tokens": 491, "generated_tokens": 82, "generation_seconds": 3.7208, "answer": "住中山路和轮渡片区，适合第一次来厦门、重点玩鼓浪屿和老城的人。资料认为这个片区的生活和吃饭更方便，上岛组织也更顺。[1]\n\n上岛前要确认鼓浪屿轮渡的出发码头、上岛码头和返程码头，资料提醒这些信息可能调整，出发前最好先核实。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-010", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "bf06088279270f5239a8ea710b56c3fff6c0952f2affa76b04fcdd37ac4234e4", "prompt_tokens": 562, "generated_tokens": 142, "generation_seconds": 6.4093, "answer": "第一天可按老城和中山路、轮渡片区、沙坡尾或厦门老城步行安排，不建议当天匆忙上岛再赶回来。[1]\n\n鼓浪屿更适合完整时段，岛上的步行、轮渡、拍照和建筑漫游都决定了它不适合被压缩成匆忙插空项目。[1]\n\n第 3 天可按环岛路、海边休闲、曾厝垵或厦大周边收尾；如果只有 2 天，这部分可以缩减。[1]\n\n鼓浪屿需要轮渡和岛上步行，本岛则更适合随时切换吃饭、散步和海边活动，两者最好分开处理。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-011", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "60bc72c2bfe54e176aa186ca76c4b1ad66e33ce575d19008f17ab858672b1326", "prompt_tokens": 452, "generated_tokens": 68, "generation_seconds": 3.0924, "answer": "白天以中山路、厦大、沙坡尾、曾厝垵、环岛路为主时，可优先地铁加网约车的组合，岛内移动比较灵活。[1]\n\n晚上吃饭散步如果更在意便利，中山路和轮渡片区更稳；海边区域则更适合轻松慢游。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-012", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "270c2f082fa48db6d0f45cf64b9cc6ade5cb2c3cd4a3476ea85e92d5cd293561", "prompt_tokens": 429, "generated_tokens": 46, "generation_seconds": 2.1123, "answer": "可以住鼓浪屿一晚，把节奏放慢，但行李和上岛成本会更高。[1]\n\n岛上以步行为主，适合慢逛，不适合带大件行李高频往返。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
