{"id": "travel-eval-validation-014", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "constrained_planning", "input_sha256": "a8a864efc7fa62baedf144e5232bd33cedfc31841d7353b74c55a417f34a9946", "prompt_tokens": 450, "generated_tokens": 77, "generation_seconds": 3.5679, "answer": "2 天更适合只保留“本岛老城 + 鼓浪屿”主线，把环岛路、曾厝垵或厦大周边收尾。[1]\n\n如果只有 2 天，可以按本岛老城 + 鼓浪屿主线，把环岛路、曾厝垵或厦大周边缩减。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
